# Steps Taken:
---
* The PDB file of the structure of the human angiotensin-converting enzyme in complex with lisinopril was downloaded from the Protein Data Bank with accession 1O86.
* Other files included in the folder are the Full Validation Report, FASTA sequence, and the Biological Assembly 1.

# Details
---
Protein Structure: Human Angiotensin-Converting Enzyme in complex with lisinopril
Accession ID: 1O86
Organism: Homo sapiens
Method: X-Ray Diffraction
Resolution: 2.00 Å

